# $_ in func position ONLY (arg is NOT DIRECT) - does NOT wrap
# WRAP-CALL only checks args, not func position
# This documents the asymmetry: arg-only wraps, func-only does NOT wrap
# Wrap in explicit function to provide $_ as bound variable, pass identity fn
[call [fn [_] [_ 42]] [fn [x] x]]
=== out
Int(42)
